{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "أَوْلَى", "translation": "the best to claim relationship"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "(of) people"}, {"text": "بِإِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translation": "with Ibrahim"}, {"text": "لَلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(are) those who"}, {"text": "ٱتَّبَعُوهُ", "translation": "follow him"}, {"text": "وَهَـٰذَا", "translation": "and this"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّبِىُّ", "translation": "[the] Prophet"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "and those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟ ۗ", "translation": "believe[d]"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "وَلِىُّ", "translation": "(is) a Guardian"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "(of) the believers"}], "sahih": "Indeed, the most worthy of Abraham among the people are those who followed him [in submission to Allāh] and this prophet [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] and those who believe [in his message]. And Allāh is the Ally1 of the believers."}